WEBVTT

00:00:05.431 --> 00:00:08.959
Choose Sponsors in the side menu.

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:12.540
Click Demo Sponsor Ltd (test).

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:15.441
Click Report.

00:00:15.691 --> 00:00:19.153
Type "03032026" in the From box.

00:00:19.403 --> 00:00:22.340
Click Show.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:27.191
Check that Impressions
shows in the number tiles.

00:00:27.441 --> 00:00:32.578
Check that Reach is a daily
figure shows under the tiles.

00:00:32.828 --> 00:00:35.478
Click Download CSV.

00:00:35.728 --> 00:00:38.381
Click Print.
